# Keep the published plugin archive lean + self-contained: ship the SOURCE that consumers compile
# (android/, ios/, macos/, linux/, windows/, cargokit/, rust/src + Cargo.toml/Cargo.lock), but
# exclude all build outputs and machine-specific junk. The rust/ crate is vendored into this package
# by tool/sync_native.sh before publishing (its canonical source is packages/iroh_quic/rust).
#
# NOTE: a .pubignore fully overrides this directory's .gitignore for publishing, so every exclusion
# we rely on must be listed HERE.
rust/target/
**/.gradle/
**/build/
**/Pods/
**/.symlinks/
**/ephemeral/
**/Podfile.lock
**/xcuserdata/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
example/
